    <tr><td class="mono">RV-04</td><td>Anchor status auto-advances and is shown consistently.</td><td><span class="rt rt-observed">Confirmed</span></td><td>WF-03-S01</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mono">RV-05</td><td>The engineering test-report PDF itself depends on the AI service (HTTP 500 without a key).</td><td><span class="rt rt-contradicted">Refined</span></td><td>Server log</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mono">RV-06</td><td>Drill-log XLSX export works — a 5-sheet workbook.</td><td><span class="rt rt-observed">Confirmed</span></td><td>WF-09-S01</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mono">RV-07</td><td>Report Builder produces a live multi-page PDF with signatory metadata.</td><td><span class="rt rt-observed">Confirmed</span></td><td>WF-09-S04</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mono">RV-08</td><td><code>RESEND_API_KEY</code> is required at boot (server crashes without it).</td><td><span class="rt rt-contradicted">Contradicted</span></td><td>Boot log</td></tr>
