<Panel title="Recommended Product Definition updates (not applied here)" tone="warn">
  <p>Two narrow corrections surfaced: <strong>RV-05</strong> — note the test-report PDF's AI
  dependency; <strong>RV-08</strong> — add <code>RESEND_API_KEY</code> to the effective
